# Hugging Face resolver cache. The default cache root moved to
# ~/.nomicous/hf/cache when hf:// resolution moved into the published package,
# but HF_CACHE_ROOT can still point here and older checkouts have one.
# inference/hub/cache.py shutil.rmtree()s the model directories under it
# whenever a cached artifact fails verification, so a tracked file in this tree
# is deleted by the application at runtime. Weights are resolved from the Hub
# on demand and must never be committed.
/src/hf/cache/

# Build output of the published `nomicous-inference` wheel.
/dist/
# Local agent tooling state. `worktrees/` in particular holds full checkouts of
# this repo, so committing one would nest the tree inside itself and make
# `ruff check .` lint every copy. Nothing here is authored by hand or shared.
/.claude/

# Local tool cache (graphify) — build artefact, never source.
graphify-out/

# Exported ONNX artifacts in the Hub staging tree (ADR 0006). Derived, not
# source: `src/model/inference_export/` produces them from the tracked `.pt` /
# `.safetensors` beside them, and the published bytes live on the Hub at a
# pinned revision + digest. Committing a copy would create a third version that
# can drift from both - which is the exact defect ADR 0006 had to fix, where the
# published blla.onnx no longer matched what the exporter produced.
src/hf/staging/**/*.onnx
